---
import { site } from '../../data/site.js';
---

<section data-hero class="relative flex min-h-svh items-center pt-28 pb-16 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-24">
  <div class="container-x grid w-full items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6">
      <p
        data-hero-item
        class="mb-6 text-[0.78rem] font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-forest-soft uppercase"
      >
        Montevideo · desde 2019
      </p>

      <h1 data-hero-item class="text-[3.4rem] sm:text-[4.5rem] md:text-[5rem] lg:text-[4.2rem] xl:text-[5.4rem]">
        Comida real,<br />sin vueltas.
      </h1>

      <p
        data-hero-item
        class="mt-7 max-w-[46ch] text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-forest-soft lg:text-[1.15rem]"
      >
        Bowls que armamos a la vista, con verdura que compramos cada mañana. Pedís, esperás cinco
        minutos y seguís con tu día.
      </p>

      <div data-hero-item class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-4">
        <a
          href={site.orderUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="rounded-full bg-leaf px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-leaf-dark"
        >
          Hacé tu pedido
        </a>
        <a href="/menu" class="link-arrow font-medium">Ver el menú</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
      <div
        data-hero-media
        data-parallax-frame
        class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] bg-cream-deep sm:aspect-[3/4] lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[76vh]"
      >
        <img
          data-parallax
          src="/img/hero.svg"
          alt="Bowl de hojas verdes, palta y semillas recién armado sobre la barra"
          width="1200"
          height="1500"
          class="absolute top-[-9%] left-0 h-[118%] w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
